OL,3,GNEWSAShirley Ballas thanks
OL,4,Aimpressionist for 'bringing joy'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Shirley met Shirley. I was in the wig,
OL,7,FI had the dress on and we filmed a
OL,8,Flittle bit," a Cheshire comedian said
OL,9,Fas she recalled meeting Shirley Ballas.
OL,11,FAmy Nic, from Warrington, has about
OL,12,F40,000 followers on Instagram and
OL,13,FTikTok and her video impressions of the
OL,14,FStrictly Come Dancing judge have become
OL,15,Fpopular online.
OL,17,FThey have caught the attention of
OL,18,FStrictly dancers and Ballas herself,
OL,19,Fwho thanked Nic for "bringing joy to my
OL,20,Fsocial media".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
