OL,3,GNEWSAShirley Ballas thanks
OL,4,Aimpressionist for 'bringing joy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNic, who does impressions of Ballas'
OL,7,Fvoice and acts out her body language,
OL,8,Fsaid when she met her she "had to drop
OL,9,Fthe voice straight away because I was
OL,10,Flike, you actually need to know that
OL,11,FI'm a real person".
